{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"docker.io/portainer/portainer-ee","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:06:26.817Z","source":{"name":"Docker Hub","api":"https://hub.docker.com/v2/repositories/portainer/portainer-ee/","page":"https://hub.docker.com/r/portainer/portainer-ee"},"readme":"**Portainer Business Edition**  is a universal container management platform to deploy, configure, troubleshoot, and secure containerized applications across cloud, data center, edge, and Industrial IoT use cases. Portainer is trusted by customers across various industries, including financial services, information technology, manufacturing, energy, automotive, and healthcare, to simplify the adoption of containers securely with exceptional speed.\n\n**Portainer Business Edition** offers the perfect blend of infrastructure versatility, self-service freedom, and compliance guardrails to deliver containerized applications in a way that suits every part of the organization. Portainer provides extensive support for container orchestrators across every deployment scenario and helps bridge the knowledge gap within every organization.\n\n**Portainer Business Edition** consists of a single container that can run on any cluster with support for running containers on Kubernetes, Docker, and Docker Swarm.\n\n## Getting started\n\n- [3 Nodes Free – Leverage BE on 3 Nodes for as long as you want](https://www.portainer.io/take-3)\n- [Get Started Today](https://www.portainer.io/get-started)\n- [Buy more Portainer Business nodes](https://www.portainer.io/pricing)\n- [Documentation](https://docs.portainer.io)\n\n## Getting help\n\nFor BE support:\n\n- [Issues](https://www.portainer.io/portainer-business-support)\n- [FAQ](https://documentation.portainer.io)\n- [Slack](https://join.slack.com/t/portainer/shared_invite/zt-txh3ljab-52QHTyjCqbe5RibC2lcjKA)","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"portainer","url":"https://hub.docker.com/u/portainer","official":false,"verified":false},"registered":"2020-11-1